<title>USA: Paychex Inc sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Paychex Inc sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paychex Inc said its board declared a three-for-two stock split, payable May 29, record May 8.</p>
<p>In addition the board declared an unchanged quarterly dividend of $0.09 per share payable May 22, record May 1. The regular dividend is payable prior to the payment date of the stock split.</p>
</text>
